
### Create project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "My Game", "slug": "my-game", "tagline": "A cozy farming game", "vision": "Where we are headed..." }

### Same slug again (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dupe", "slug": "my-game" }

### Bad slug (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad", "slug": "A" }

### My projects
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/mine

### Public page
GET http://localhost:5000/api/projects/my-game

### Update (paste the id from the create response)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/projects/PASTE-ID-HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tagline": "Now with fishing" }
